<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">It’s no secret that insurance calls have high conversion rates and provide some of the best opportunities for agents to write new business.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">With EverQuote’s </span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://2287971.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2287971/Consumer-Initiated%20Inbound%20Calls%201-Pager.pdf" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">Consumer-Initiated Inbound Calls</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> we take it a step further – delivering </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">insurance shoppers who have dialed in to request a quote </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">directly to your phone.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Since these are some of the highest intent prospects you can connect with demand for these Calls is extremely high. If you’re interested give me a call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or book time with a Calls Specialist via this link:&nbsp;{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

